<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:2.0" xmlns:mda="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:metadata:2.0" version="2.0" srcLang="en" trgLang="uk">
  <file id="dialogs\support\wa_injured.txt" original="dialogs\support\wa_injured.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It won't help my broken arm heal any faster... but thanks, $(#man/sis)! Thanks for the aid.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Це не прискорить загоєння моєї зламаної руки… але дякую, $(#чоловіче/сестро)! Дякую за допомогу.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm doing alright.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">У мене все гаразд.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I broke my arm. Yes.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я зламав руку. Так.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Ow. Don't touch it, $(#man/sis).&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ой. Не торкайся, $(#man/sis).&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I tripped and fell while carrying some ammo boxes. Stupid fall, really.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я спіткнувся і впав, коли ніс ящики з набоями. Дурна випадковість, насправді.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Landed right on my arm - and the thinner of the two bones cracked like an undercane!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Приземлився прямо мені на руку – і тонша з двох кісток тріснула, як суха гілка!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It hurts occasionally, but not too much. It's getting better.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Іноді болить, але не сильно. Стає краще.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Ouch.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ой.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It's gonna take a while before I'll be able to use the arm properly again.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мине деякий час, перш ніж я зможу нормально використовувати руку.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It could've been much worse: I could've fallen off the platform and died.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Все могло бути набагато гірше: я міг впасти з платформи і померти.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>This is the second time I'm breaking a bone. I broke my ankle a few years ago.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Це вже другий раз, коли я ламаю кістку. Кілька років тому я зламав щиколотку.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Thanks for the aid, $(#man/sis).&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Дякую за допомогу, $(#man/sis).&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>So, what's up with you?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ну що з тобою?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
  </file>
</xliff>